"Delivered: the general INTERACTIVE surface (user-approved design) -- OfferedActionsComponent lists actions an OBJECT offers to anyone co-located, independent of the actor's known actions; new ActionType::Interact is valid only against a co-located target offering that very action (queue-time refusal otherwise). Open effect: one-way open flag; contents revealed and takeable IN PLACE (take reach extended to open co-located containers, client renders insides beside the container). Dump effect: spill_contents to the floor, container unharmed. Which interactions a container supports is explicit data (offeredActionNames on the blob), never inferred from appearance. Prod: chests/cabinets/strongboxes open, sacks/baskets/urns dump, barrels both, jars/crates/racks/stumps/logs smash-only; smashing always remains an option. e2e phase 21 (4 tests) + actionOptions unit tests. Future reuse: doors, levers; attunement could migrate onto offers."